  "worked_solution": "First, we factor the ${sin}^{2}\u2061x$ from the first two terms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{sin}^{2}\u2061x+{sin}^{2}\u2061x\\cdot {cot}^{2}\u2061x+1 & ={sin}^{2}\u2061x(1+{cot}^{2}\u2061x)+1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, using the identity $1+{cot}^{2}\u2061x={csc}^{2}\u2061x,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{sin}^{2}\u2061x(1+{cot}^{2}\u2061x)+1 & ={sin}^{2}\u2061x({csc}^{2}\u2061x)+1 \\\\  & =\\cancel{{sin}^{2}\u2061x}(\\frac{1}{\\cancel{{sin}^{2}\u2061x}})+1 \\\\  & =1+1 \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
